# Internal development context, direction, and instruction — not public-facing
# Only public-facing documents are exposed on GitHub:
#   README.md (root), docs/README.md (index), docs/BRAND.md (brand)
# =============================================================================

# Root-level internal context/instruction files
AGENTS.md
CLOSURE_SUMMARY.md
DEPLOYMENT_STATE.md
MOBILE_BACKEND_REVIEW.md
